error[E0101]: `a` is a `Named`, which cannot be turned into text by itself
help: call its `text` method: `a::text()`
error[E0101]: `p` is a `Plain`, which cannot be turned into text by itself
help: put its fields in the text one by one
error[E0101]: `io::outln` prints text, found `Named`
error[E0101]: `match` works on numbers and bools, not `Plain`
error[E0101]: `+` joins strings, but the right side is `Plain`
help: turn it into text: `n::text()`
